.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cursor-session-list 1  "cursor-session 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cursor\-session\-list \- List sessions, most recently updated first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcursor\-session list\fR [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-storage\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List sessions, most recently updated first
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Only read this store; the other one is never opened
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
agent: Cursor Agent CLI chats (~/.cursor/chats and agent transcripts)
.IP \(bu 2
ide: Cursor IDE composer chats (state.vscdb)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<N>\fR
Keep only the N most recently updated sessions
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print a JSON array of session summaries
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-storage\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read only this location: a home, .cursor, chats, workspace, session or projects directory, a store.db or state.vscdb file, or the directory that holds state.vscdb
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the storage paths in use and the rows and files that were skipped to stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
When to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
.nf
cursor\-session list
cursor\-session list \-\-source ide \-\-limit 5
cursor\-session list \-\-json | jq \-r \*(Aq.[].id\*(Aq
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.RS 4
.nf
0  Success, also when output is cut short by a closed pipe (e.g. `| head`)
1  Error: session not found, unreadable storage, failed healthcheck
2  Usage error: unknown command or flag, invalid value
.fi
.RE
